  "2026-10-28T19:28:02.872Z",codex-agent,"Original failure: the Node 22 polynomial-redos timing regression measured 8.43x against its unchanged 8x bound; no workflow contract assertion failed. Requested exactly one rerun of job 122183401263 at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/actions/runs/40502498772 (attempt 2). Current main merged with a two-parent merge; the focused timing test passes locally. No implementation or threshold change is justified pending the rerun."
  "2026-10-28T19:35:10.695Z",codex-agent,"Cause class: stale CHANGELOG on the behind branch. The single original-head rerun at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/actions/runs/40502498772/attempts/2 passed the original timing assertion but failed changelog:check because the newer release tag adds the missing release section. Current main supplies that section and regenerated changelog:check passes. This is not classified as a flaky job. No production code or test threshold changed; behavioral revert is not applicable to main synchronization and generated documentation."
  "2026-10-28T19:38:39.753Z",codex-agent,"Focused regression passed 1/1 through pm test. Regenerated changelog:check passed. Repair CI evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/actions/runs/40755989509; this run exercises npm and Bun release:check on Node 22 and 26. Completion requires observing the final pushed head green; local release checking is still running."
